message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Open Thermal Engineering Teaching Suite"
type: software
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-06"
authors:
  - family-names: "maxisnote20"
    email: "maxisnote20@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/open-nuclear-suite/Open-Thermal-Engineering-Teaching-Suite"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Interactive Windows desktop applications for teaching thermodynamic
  properties and boiler-furnace operation. Thermophysical property calculations
  in the P-v-T Demonstrator use CoolProp. Water-and-steam properties in the
  boiler-furnace simulator use CoolProp's IAPWS-IF97 backend within simplified
  educational combustion, heat-transfer, emissions, and control models.
keywords:
  - thermal engineering education
  - thermodynamics
  - P-v-T properties
  - boiler furnace
  - combustion
